e.","name":"Learning signals"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-text.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x180","subtitle":"Four greys carry all reading. Accent colours never carry sentences.","name":"Text roles on ink"},{"path":"components/core/core.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x400","subtitle":"Button, IconButton, Badge, Tag, Card, Rule, Icon","name":"Core"},{"path":"components/feedback/feedback.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x480","subtitle":"WarningNotice, Toast, Tooltip, Dialog","name":"Feedback"},{"path":"components/forms/forms.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x440","subtitle":"Input, Textarea, Select, Checkbox, Radio, Switch","name":"Forms"},{"path":"components/learning/learning.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x620","subtitle":"ChoiceOption, PillChoice, ScoreMeter, ChatBubble, SwipeCard, Redacted, Stamp, ChapterCard, LockedPanel","name":"Learning"},{"path":"components/navigation/navigation.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x280","subtitle":"Tabs, ProgressRail (horizontal & vertical)","name":"Navigation"},{"path":"ui_kits/elearning-mobile/index.html","group":"E-Learning","viewport":"520x1000","subtitle":"iPhone-Ansicht: 12 Kapitel, Ernstfälle, Kompetenzprofil, Schutz & Recht","name":"fick-trainer.de Mobile"},{"path":"ui_kits/elearning/index.html","group":"E-Learning","viewport":"1280x840","subtitle":"12 Kapitel, Ernstfälle, Kompetenzprofil, Schutz & Recht","name":"fick-trainer.de E-Learning"},{"path":"ui_kits/elearning/standalone-src.html","group":"E-Learning","viewport":"1280x840","subtitle":"12 Kapitel, Ernstfälle, Kompetenzprofil, Schutz & Recht","name":"FUCKBOY E-Learning"},{"path":"guidelines/motion-easing.card.html","group":"Motion","viewport":"700x175","subtitle":"Cold and controlled. Cuts, fades and wipes — never a bounce or overshoot.","name":"Easing & duration"},{"path":"guidelines/motion-states.card.html","group":"Motion","viewport":"700x200","subtitle":"Hover lifts 2px and 